  description: '2+ Level 8 monsters

    Once per turn, you can also Xyz Summon
    "Gigantic "Champion" Sargas" by using 1 "Springans" Xyz Monster you control.
    (Transfer its materials to this card.) While this card has material: You can
    add 1 "Springans" or "Therion" card from your Deck to your hand. If material
    is detached from a monster(s) on the field (except during the Damage Step): You
    can target 1 card on the field; either destroy it or return it to the hand. You
    can only use each effect of "Gigantic "Champion" Sargas" once per turn.'
